      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ……アレキサンドラちゃん！　\nおじさん、彼女に一目惚れしちゃった！\n一生の御願いだ、ボクがしたためた\nこの恋文を彼女に届けてくれ、頼む！！！！",
        "official_en": "Ah, that wonderful Alexandra! I fell in love with\nher at first sight. Please deliver my love letter.\nThis is the dream of a lifetime!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
